      "type" : "literal" ,
      "value" : "contents:\nv. 1\nyi ge med pa'i rgyud chen po.--sgra thal 'gyur chen po'i rgyud.--kun tu bzang po klong drug pa'i rgyud.--seng+ge rtsal rdzogs chen po'i rgyud\nv. 2\nnor bu 'phra bkod chen po'i rgyud.--kun tu bzang po thugs kyi me long gi rgyud.--rdo rje sems dpa' snying gi me long gi rgyud\nngo sprod spras pa'i rgyud.--sku gdung 'bar ba'i rgyud kyi rtsa ba.--gser gyi me tog mdzes pa rin po che sgron ma 'bar ba'i rgyud.--gsang sngags lam rim gyi rgyud.--\ngsang sngags lam rim gyi dbang bka' shad dka' dang bcas pa.--nyams khrid bdud rtsi'i thigs pa.--chos spyod rgyud kyi rnal 'byor gyi skor rin po che bsil bu.--gsang sngags lam rim gyi tshig rkang.--'grel ba rin po che'i 'phreng ba." ,
      "lang" : "en"
    }
